WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.239 --> 00:00:02.239
The wall was a worldwide symbol:

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:06.759
an inhuman barrier separating the Europe of freedom

00:00:06.839 --> 00:00:09.039
from the Europe of dictatorship, 

00:00:09.319 --> 00:00:12.839
and separating people who belong together.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.519
Today we look at Berlin with hope.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.400
In East Berlin and in East Germany,

00:00:22.479 --> 00:00:24.039
the East German people’s desire for freedom

00:00:24.439 --> 00:00:27.879
as peacefully overcome the wall and the barbed wire. 

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:31.560
After almost three decades of separation,

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:35.759
Germans have been able to celebrate being reunited

00:00:35.879 --> 00:00:39.400
and together once again.

00:00:43.319 --> 00:00:45.839
All of us these days

00:00:47.119 --> 00:00:50.119
are feeling that events happening in Europe,

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:54.439
especially in central, eastern and southeastern Europe,

00:00:55.159 --> 00:00:58.280
are of historic importance.

00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:06.959
For the first time since the end of the Second World War,

00:01:07.039 --> 00:01:11.079
there is hope of overcoming East-West conflict,

00:01:11.159 --> 00:01:20.000
of lasting stability in common freedom for all of Europe.

00:01:22.079 --> 00:01:25.400
The division of Germany has always been

00:01:25.479 --> 00:01:29.079
a visible and particularly painful expression

00:01:29.159 --> 00:01:31.079
of the division of Europe.

00:01:31.159 --> 00:01:35.800
Meanwhile, the unity of Germany will only be achieved

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:40.159
if the unity of our old continent progresses.

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:47.159
The building of a united Europe

00:01:47.479 --> 00:01:51.039
is above all else a work of peace.

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:54.239
And we have to do this together.

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:01.519
Because we rely on the same strength

00:02:01.759 --> 00:02:06.119
when it comes to our vision of a European peace order.

00:02:06.439 --> 00:02:11.239
Wherever borders are crossed unhindered,

00:02:11.439 --> 00:02:15.280
where ideas and opinions are freely exchanged,

00:02:15.479 --> 00:02:18.439
where people can come together,

00:02:18.519 --> 00:02:24.119
distrust and hatred, enmity have no chance in the long run.

00:02:24.959 --> 00:02:27.720
That’s true for us West Germans,

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:31.560
it’s also the case for East Germans.

00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:35.959
It’s not just their liberty which is at stake,

00:02:36.039 --> 00:02:38.400
but that of Poles and Hungarians, 

00:02:38.759 --> 00:02:41.800
along with the future of people in the Soviet Union.

00:02:41.879 --> 00:02:46.280
Czechs and Slovaks, Bulgarians and Romanians.

00:02:46.479 --> 00:02:51.519
It is about the freedom of one Europe.

